        name="tcad-lithography",
        description="光刻闭环（Spin Resist/Exposure/PEB/Develop）调参与故障诊断：CD/open_fraction/像素化与 PR 热预算。",
        kind="process",
        tags=["tcad", "lithography", "resist", "exposure", "peb", "develop"],
